 ```
 
 #### Linux (Bash / Zsh)
 
 ```bash
-FFPWA="${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}/firefoxpwa"
-"$FFPWA/runtime/firefox" --profile "$FFPWA/profiles/<PROFILE-ULID>" --pwa "<SITE-ULID>" --remote-debugging-port 9222 &
